title: "ScarCodec v6.0, ScarField v7, Mixture of Scars (MoS), and SCache O(1): Zero-PyTorch C99/SIMD Lattice Compression, Constant-Memory Telemetry, and Zero-Legacy Spherical Neural Fields"
