abstract: "Open-source software ecosystem comprising: (1) ScarCodec v6.0, a Zero-PyTorch (NumPy + compiled C99/SIMD) library, CRC32 mmap binary format (.scar), and Zarr/numcodecs plugin (ScarZarrCodec) delivering 10.5x-21.0x IEEE-754 scientific compression (D4 VQ4 and 1.000 bpw Gosset E8), 0.388 us O(1) 64-float random block reads, 29-decade deterministic L_inf error bounds, orthogonal subspace interference nulling (P_perp), and 34,816 B (Delta=0 B) associative anomaly telemetry validated on SHA-256-verified NASA Spitzer, CSO Bolocam, FCRAO 14-m, NASA Space Shuttle, and PhysioNet archives; and (2) ScarField v7 / ScarNativeLM / MoS foundations for constant-memory and sub-2-bit neural inference across native and WebGPU runtimes."
